{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-07-13 14:38:00', 'title': "CHEF GORDON RAMSAY SET TO DEBUT LARGEST HELL'S KITCHEN CONCEPT TO DATE AT HARRAH'S RESORT SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA", 'text': "FUNNER, CALIF., JULY 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, HARRAH'S RESORT SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA ANNOUNCED THEIR PARTNERSHIP WITH CELEBRATED MULTI-MICHELIN-STARRED CHEF AND TELEVISION PERSONALITY GORDON RAMSAY TO LAUNCH A BRAND-NEW HELL'S KITCHEN RESTAURANT, SET TO DEBUT IN SPRING 2022."}